  232:                 f"another fulltext harvester holds {lock} ({who}). Two harvesters "
  233:                 f"on one corpus re-fetch the same papers and double the NCBI "
  234:                 f"rate. If that process is genuinely dead, delete the lock file.")
  235:         with os.fdopen(fd, "w") as f:
